<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 9.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Visakhapatnam Cargoes - Dec 9.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
