<p> Commodity		Tons		  Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Containers</p>
<p> Sulphur	   2,014 (ULD)  4,624     Arad		 12/12</p>
<p> Urea		4,885 (ULD) 20,203     Jag Swakti	 19/12</p>
<p> Liquid Ammonia  5,200 (ULD)  4,250     Hesoid	     09/12</p>
