<p> Phosphate	37,192 (ULD)  ----	Lucky Field	09/12</p>
<p> Coking Coal     9,380 (ULD) 37,229     Kanpur	     16/12</p>
<p> Pig Iron	     20 (LDD) 13,980     Ais Mamas	  12/12</p>
<p> Thermal Coal   25,462 (LDD)  ----	Jag Rahul	  09/12</p>
